  "description": "Provides abstractions for AWS-aware metric instrumentation in .NET applications using NetMetric. Includes interfaces for environment detection (Lambda, EC2, ECS, EKS), metric value normalization (numeric, count, statistic set), and CloudWatch-compatible dimensional tagging. Designed for high-performance telemetry pipelines with DI support and exporter decoupling.",
